%% A reseller opens an account and reaches their first order without us.
%%
%% The two halves worth reading together: registration answers 201 with no
%% body whatever the address was — so probing addresses looks identical to
%% owning one — and the confirmation link is what signs them in, because
%% holding it already proves the mailbox the password form was trying to
%% establish.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Op as Reseller's operator
    participant Cab as Cabinet (reseller.yupay.uz)
    participant BFF as /merchant/cabinet
    participant Auth as merchants.cabinet_auth
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Mail as notifications.email
    actor Sup as YuPay support

    Op->>Cab: fill sign-up, tick the offer
    Cab->>BFF: POST /register {email, password, title, accept_offer}
    BFF->>BFF: guard_ip(bucket=merchant_register)
    Note over BFF: refuses outright if merchant_cabinet_url is unset —<br/>an account whose link can never arrive is worse than none
    BFF->>Auth: register()
    Auth->>DB: INSERT merchants, merchant_users<br/>(argon2 hash, offer_version + offer_accepted_at together)
    Auth-->>BFF: user, confirm token (24h)
    BFF->>Mail: confirmation link
    BFF-->>Cab: 201, no body
    Note over Cab,BFF: identical for an address already taken

    Op->>Cab: open the link
    Cab->>BFF: POST /confirm {token}
    BFF->>Auth: confirm_email()
    Auth->>DB: mark confirmed, INSERT merchant_sessions<br/>(sha256 of the refresh token)
    Auth-->>BFF: merchant_access (15 min) + refresh (30 d)
    BFF-->>Cab: tokens
    Cab->>Cab: store in localStorage

    Op->>Cab: /cabinet
    Cab->>BFF: GET /me
    BFF->>DB: deposit.deposit_balance()
    BFF-->>Cab: profile, balance $0.00
    Note over Op,Sup: the one step that is not self-serve —<br/>crediting a deposit is support's job, by design

    Sup->>DB: POST /admin/merchants/{id}/deposit-credits
    Op->>Cab: /cabinet/catalog → pick a SKU → order
    Cab->>BFF: POST /orders {sku_id, quantity, expected_price}
    BFF->>BFF: mint merchant_order_id = manual-<uuid>
    Note over BFF: from here it is the machine API's own path:<br/>quote → margin floor → charge deposit → enqueue fulfilment
    BFF-->>Cab: 201 {merchant_order_id, status, price_usd, balance_usd}
